+.. method:: jinja2.Environment.set_translation_cache_partition(value)
+
+    Set the translation cache partition and clear all cached entries.
+    
+    Applications whose translation result depends on locale or request state
+    should use distinct partition values for each state. This allows multiple
+    independent caches to coexist within the same environment.
+    
+    .. versionadded:: 3.1
+
+.. method:: jinja2.Environment.clear_translation_cache()
+
+    Clear all cached translation results.
+    
+    .. versionadded:: 3.1
+
+.. method:: jinja2.Environment.resize_translation_cache(capacity)
+
+    Resize the translation cache to the given capacity. A value of 0 disables
+    caching and clears all entries. Negative values raise :exc:`ValueError`.
+    
+    The new capacity is applied immediately, affecting subsequent gettext calls.
+    
+    .. versionadded:: 3.1
